  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {受容|じゅよう}{体|たい} (receptor — biology/medicine)\n- {自己|じこ}{受容|じゅよう} (self-acceptance)\n- {文化|ぶんか}の{受容|じゅよう} (cultural reception/acceptance)\n- {受容|じゅよう}と{拒絶|きょぜつ} (acceptance and rejection)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\nThe homophone {需要|じゅよう} (demand, as in supply and demand) is a completely different word. {受容|じゅよう} focuses on accepting or embracing something. Compared to {受|う}け{入|い}れる (to accept), {受容|じゅよう} is more formal and academic, often appearing in psychology, philosophy, and cultural studies.",
